Immersion is a wholly-owned subsidiary of NPC, Inc. (www.npcweb.com), a privately-owned print and electronic document solutions company located in Claysburg, Altoona and Roaring Spring, PA. The top ranked vendor to the Government Printing Office, much of the work NPC performs involves sensitive and confidential information.

